WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.023 --> 00:00:05.457
Ringo gasped. "I'm not a rookie?

2
00:00:05.458 --> 00:00:08.845
But I got this message from Space Patrol."

3
00:00:08.846 --> 00:00:11.796
He showed it to Captain Nova.

4
00:00:11.797 --> 00:00:18.430
Captain Nova sighed. "It's very busy here.

5
00:00:18.431 --> 00:00:21.132
That message was a big mistake."

6
00:00:21.133 --> 00:00:29.243
Lucy grinned. "A little mistake!"

7
00:00:29.244 --> 00:00:35.705
"Please, Captain," Ringo said. "Let me stay."

8
00:00:35.706 --> 00:00:40.425
Captain Nova folded her arms. "Tell me, Ringo.

9
00:00:40.426 --> 00:00:43.241
Why should you stay?"

10
00:00:43.242 --> 00:00:48.153
Ringo thought for a minute.

11
00:00:48.154 --> 00:00:53.029
"Send him home," Lucy said.

12
00:00:53.030 --> 00:00:55.685
A screen suddenly lit up.

13
00:00:55.686 --> 00:00:59.132
"Ugh," Captain Nova groaned.

14
00:00:59.133 --> 00:01:01.907
"It's Commander Cosmo again.

15
00:01:01.908 --> 00:01:04.940
He keeps giving me work."

16
00:01:04.941 --> 00:01:08.053
"I'm smart!" Ringo said.

17
00:01:08.054 --> 00:01:10.697
"I can help you with your work."

18
00:01:10.698 --> 00:01:16.660
Captain Nova tapped her chin.

19
00:01:16.661 --> 00:01:22.354
"Fine. You can stay."

20
00:01:22.355 --> 00:01:25.581
"You two need robots," Captain Nova said.

21
00:01:25.582 --> 00:01:34.086
She pressed a button.

22
00:01:34.087 --> 00:01:38.831
A shiny robot came out.

23
00:01:38.832 --> 00:01:42.938
"That's a PJ-4000!" Lucy said.

24
00:01:42.939 --> 00:01:44.529
"I'll take him.

25
00:01:44.530 --> 00:01:59.035
Come on, PJ!"

26
00:01:59.036 --> 00:02:01.868
Ringo saw an old robot.

27
00:02:01.869 --> 00:02:09.864
It had dents and rust.

28
00:02:09.865 --> 00:02:14.501
"I'm out of new robots, Ringo," Captain Nova said.

29
00:02:14.502 --> 00:02:17.134
She pointed to the old robot.

30
00:02:17.135 --> 00:02:19.916
"You can use this one.

31
00:02:19.917 --> 00:02:24.301
Her name is Bot."

